WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.529
Welcome to Orbit. Choices and consequences. Our focus is Second Conditional.

2
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:15.837
Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation.

3
00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:19.151
I would not buy it if it were too expensive.

4
00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.035
What would you do if you had a free year?

5
00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:26.119
If Daniel accepted, he would live further away.

6
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:35.517
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
